              "message": "feat: startup update prompt modal and direct self-updating (#4138)\n\n* feat: startup update prompt modal and direct self-updating\n\nThe update flow (check at start or on request, the startup prompt, the self-update worker) is craft-update's Updater; the app only supplies the suite, its close path and its status window. The check at start is opt-in for the desktop app, and the Windows update helper runs before argument parsing.\n\nRef: storytold/craft-libs#319\n\n* refactor(updates): hold the install back while documents are unsaved\n\n* fix(updates): drop the manual window's custom id; pin craft-update to craft-libs main (db19c37)\n\n* fix(updates): address review feedback\n\nWake the UI when a manual check is queued from a menu callback; the update prompt owns the keyboard while it is open (LightCraft); Download opens through the desktop URL hook (FilmCraft); the Help menu dispatches through menus::invoke (FigCraft); print jobs and comment drafts hold an install back (WordCraft); Check for Updates is a registered command (GridCraft); an install holds back while documents are unsaved.\n\n* fix(updates): localize the update status messages\n\n* build: resolve the craft-update pin after rebasing",
